cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "STORM: Severe Thunderstorm Observation and Reconaissance Monitor"
abstract: >-
  STORM is a desktop application for severe storm field operation situational awareness,
  designed for low-bandwidth field environments. It provides offline map
  rendering, live NEXRAD radar integration, multi-vehicle GPS tracking,
  and team communication over constrained networks.
